    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "ce09ee1586b6afc80798bcf986d9ab7e",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Differentiate before reduction:</strong>\n$<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\partial_a B=I(2,1),\\quad \\partial_b B=I(1,2),\\quad\n\\partial_s B=\\frac{I(0,2)-I(1,1)+(a-b-s)I(1,2)}{2s}.||)</marimo-tex>$\n<strong>Checks:</strong> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(s\\partial_sB+a\\partial_aB+b\\partial_bB=(D/2-2)B||)</marimo-tex>,\nand all three compatibility matrices\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\partial_vM_w-\\partial_wM_v+M_wM_v-M_vM_w||)</marimo-tex> vanish exactly.</span></span></div>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
