      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Connection matrix M_s</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">[[0, 0, 0],\n [0, 0, 0],\n [(2\u00b7b-2\u00b7a-D\u00b7b+D\u00b7a+2\u00b7s-s\u00b7D)/(2\u00b7s\u00b7b\u00b2-4\u00b7s\u00b7a\u00b7b+2\u00b7s\u00b7a\u00b2-4\u00b7s\u00b2\u00b7b-4\u00b7s\u00b2\u00b7a+2\u00b7s\u00b3), (-2\u00b7b+2\u00b7a+D\u00b7b-D\u00b7a+2\u00b7s-s\u00b7D)/(2\u00b7s\u00b7b\u00b2-4\u00b7s\u00b7a\u00b7b+2\u00b7s\u00b7a\u00b2-4\u00b7s\u00b2\u00b7b-4\u00b7s\u00b2\u00b7a+2\u00b7s\u00b3), (2\u00b7b\u00b2-4\u00b7a\u00b7b+2\u00b7a\u00b2-D\u00b7b\u00b2+2\u00b7D\u00b7a\u00b7b-D\u00b7a\u00b2+2\u00b7s\u00b7b+2\u00b7s\u00b7a-4\u00b7s\u00b2+s\u00b2\u00b7D)/(2\u00b7s\u00b7b\u00b2-4\u00b7s\u00b7a\u00b7b+2\u00b7s\u00b7a\u00b2-4\u00b7s\u00b2\u00b7b-4\u00b7s\u00b2\u00b7a+2\u00b7s\u00b3)]]</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Finite derivative after expanding at D=4\u22122\u03b5</strong></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">-<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>-s\u00b7a-s\u00b7a\u00b7bubble_finite-s\u00b7b-s\u00b7b\u00b7bubble_finite+s\u00b7A_finite+s\u00b7B_finite\n    -2\u00b7a\u00b7b\u00b7bubble_finite-a\u00b7A_finite+a\u00b7B_finite+b\u00b7A_finite-b\u00b7B_finite+s\u00b2\n    +a\u00b2\u00b7bubble_finite+b\u00b2\u00b7bubble_finite\n<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span>/<span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">(</span>s\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">(</span>-2\u00b7s\u00b7a-2\u00b7s\u00b7b-2\u00b7a\u00b7b+s\u00b2+a\u00b2+b\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 95, 175)\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(128, 128, 128)\">)</span></div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Independent parameter integral:\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(B_{\\rm finite}=-\\int_0^1\\log[\\Delta(x)/\\mu^2]\\,dx||)</marimo-tex>,\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Delta=ax+b(1-x)-sx(1-x)||)</marimo-tex>. Its <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(s,a,b||)</marimo-tex> derivatives have numerators\n<marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(x(1-x),-x,-(1-x)||)</marimo-tex> over <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\Delta||)</marimo-tex>. The presets stay below threshold.</span></span><marimo-ui-element object-id='SFPL-0' random-id='f31b4504-50d0-7485-2875-54ce1d039bcd'><marimo-table data-initial-value='[]' data-label='null' data-data='&quot;[{&#92;&quot;IBP derivative&#92;&quot;:&#92;&quot;(0.048198984285501005+0j)&#92;&quot;,&#92;&quot;Parameter derivative&#92;&quot;:0.04819898428550073,&#92;&quot;Absolute error&#92;&quot;:2.7755575615628914e-16}]&quot;' data-total-rows='1' data-total-columns='3' data-max-columns='50' data-banner-text='&quot;&quot;' data-pagination='false' data-page-size='10' data-show-filters='false' data-show-download='true' data-show-search='true' data-show-column-summaries='false' data-show-data-types='true' data-show-page-size-selector='false' data-show-column-explorer='true' data-show-chart-builder='true' data-row-headers='[]' data-hidden-columns='[]' data-has-stable-row-id='false' data-lazy='false' data-preload='false'></marimo-table></marimo-ui-element></div>"
          }
